WEBVTT

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:00.724
Notice what Mohamed didn't say.

00:08:00.748 --> 00:08:03.971
He didn't tell the group he was afraid
he would forget his material

00:08:03.995 --> 00:08:05.766
or stumble over his words.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.116
The fear he expressed
was about the audience,

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.929
not his preparation.

00:08:09.953 --> 00:08:11.936
(Musical interlude)

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:22.256
AG: When we hear, "Be authentic,"

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:24.656
many of us hear, "Be more honest,"

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:26.261
which is another way of saying,

00:08:26.285 --> 00:08:29.836
"Don't sugarcoat things.
Say what you really think."

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.973
That's another kind of authenticity,